  <prompt>
    Each "What I changed" confirmation entry gets a BOLD location indicator in its header (the clause location label
    from clauseLocation.ts) + clear whitespace separation between entries — so a batch of confirmations (041 emits many)
    reads as distinct per-clause outcomes instead of a run-together wall.
  </prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. ConversationPane confirmation rendering, Fluent v9 typography.</role>
  <goal>Confirmations are visually distinct entries, each led by a bold clause-location header.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Seam: makeComposeEditControlsMessage / COMPOSE_EDIT_CONFIRMATION rendering in ConversationPane (~L163/L941 per
      nda-r1 notes — re-locate). Thread the section location (computed clause label, from the note/finding metadata)
      into the header, bold via Fluent tokens; add inter-entry spacing. Sequenced after 041 (same file; hot-file rule).
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/src/components/conversation/ConversationPane.tsx (confirmation rendering)</file>
    </relevant-files>
