  <notes>
    Spec FR-12; design Lens 2 #4. COMPLETED 2026-07-31. Renderer seam: `dispatchComposeAction` in
    ConversationPane.tsx (confirmed unmoved since baseline f0e1c8144 — 021/031/041 all landed
    elsewhere; 041's own notes confirm ConversationPane.tsx untouched). Added
