    read-only for this task). Implementation is forward-compatible (checks `locationLabel`/`sectionRef`/
    `location` on both request slots and result payload) and gracefully omits the header today (proven
    byte-identical to pre-042 via the existing locked `ConversationPane.compose-edit-controls.test.tsx`,
    left untouched). Recommend a fast-follow task to add ONE field to `ComposeEditor.tsx`'s
    `dispatchNoteToolRequest` slots — see notes/042-execution-notes.md for full detail + escalation.
    New tests: `ConversationPane.compose-edit-location-header.test.tsx` (6 cases). Full suite: 91
    suites/838 tests green (baseline 90/832 + this task's 6). Build green.
